\newlabel{fig:interface}{{8}{7}{\textbf {Where neighbours meet.} Two adjacent interior predictions overlap by $2\delta $ (indigo band). At inference the partition of unity blends them smoothly; at training time (path b, Section~\ref {sec:training}) the interface term penalizes their disagreement on exactly this band.\relax }{figure.caption.12}{}}
